- Intervention: Non-pharmacological pain management strategies vs no-treatment control
- Additive effects allowed on: sweet solution, non-nutritive sucking, or swaddling only
- Explicitly EXCLUDED interventions: kangaroo care, sucrose, breastfeeding/breast milk, music

**Included Studies (n=57):**
Studies testing acupressure, eye covering, intrauterine sounds, amniotic fluid smell, facilitated tucking, maternal 
voice, cobedding, parental presence/intervention, multisensory stimulation/sensorial saturation, parent education, 
rocking, pacifiers, environmental/behavioral interventions, magnetic acupuncture, massage, developmental care, 
